<title>CANADA: Agrium says not in Vietnam plant commitment.</title>
<headline>Agrium says not in Vietnam plant commitment.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian fertilizer maker Agrium Inc on Thursday denied it had made commitments to build a nitrogen fertilizer facility in Vietnam, but said preliminary discussions were under way.</p>
</text>
